{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":12,"result":{"contents":{"kind":"markdown","value":"```manuscript\nList List[T]\n```\n\nAn ordered mutable collection with indexing, iteration and transformations.\nStart with a literal such as `[\"docs\", \"release\"]`; use `var` when you want to append, remove or replace items.\nA list has one owner; `clone()` makes a deep copy, and `xs[i]` and accessors such as `first` borrow elements.\n`List[T]()` creates an empty list. `List[T](reserve: n)` also preallocates room for `n` items without changing the length; a negative `n` reserves nothing."},"range":{"start":{"line":90,"character":3},"end":{"line":90,"character":7}}}}
